    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Create Achievement Type from Course Template\n\n**Flow**\n1. The *Create Achievement Type* manual event on a Course Template creates a matching Achievement Type\n2. Slack sends you a link to the instructor selection form (or the creation error)\n3. Open the link, tick the instructors and submit\n4. The Achievement is awarded to each selected instructor\n\n**Setup**\n- Fill in the **Config** node\n- Set the Administrate credential on the trigger and every HTTP node\n- Set the Slack credential on both Slack nodes\n- Activate, then copy the production URLs of **Form Display** and **Form Submission** into Config\n\nAll three entry points run through **Config**, then **Route by Entry Point** sends each one down its own path.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        656,
        -1072
      ],
      "id": "a27e1eb2-d4dd-4129-a49b-54f157f13473",
      "name": "Note: Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ Edit Config\n- `adminUrl`: your Administrate GraphQL endpoint\n- `formDisplayUrl`: production URL of **Form Display**\n- `formSubmitUrl`: production URL of **Form Submission**\n- `validityPeriodYears`: years the Achievement stays valid\n- `SLACK_USER_ID`: Slack member ID to notify\n- `INSTRUCTOR_ROLE_NAME`: Staff Role that marks a Contact as an instructor",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1168,
        -512
